## .NET build output
bin/
obj/
publish/

## Umbraco
umbraco/Data/*
!umbraco/Data/.gitkeep
umbraco/Logs/*
!umbraco/Logs/.gitkeep
umbraco/mediacache/*
!umbraco/mediacache/.gitkeep
App_Data/
wwwroot/media/*
!wwwroot/media/.gitkeep

## uSync exports. Content and media are mirroring artifacts and must never go in the repo.
## The schema (ContentTypes/DataTypes) belongs to prod and is only committed from an export taken
## from PROD. See uSync/README.md.
uSync/*
!uSync/README.md
!uSync/v17
uSync/v17/*
!uSync/v17/.origin
!uSync/v17/ContentTypes
!uSync/v17/DataTypes

## SQLite database
*.sqlite.db
*.sqlite.db-shm
*.sqlite.db-wal

## Auto-generated schemas
umbraco-package-schema.json
appsettings-schema.*.json

## Generated mirror of /shared/content-routes.json (see scripts/sync-content-routes.js).
## The only source is /shared/content-routes.json. The mirror is created at build.
content-routes.json

## User secrets
appsettings.*.local.json
.cms-running.lock
